1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,960
Five things you must do in
Mongolia.

2
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,809
Do sleep in a ger with a nomad
family.

3
00:00:08,059 --> 00:00:10,227
Do taste airag, fermented mare's
milk.

4
00:00:10,277 --> 00:00:12,444
Accept the bowl with your right
hand.

5
00:00:13,694 --> 00:00:15,497
Do climb the Khongoryn dunes.

6
00:00:15,547 --> 00:00:17,926
They rise up to 300 meters.

7
00:00:19,176 --> 00:00:23,923
Do watch the sunset at the Flaming
Cliffs, where the first dinosaur
eggs were found.

8
00:00:25,173 --> 00:00:27,222
And do watch Kazakh eagle hunters.

9
00:00:27,272 --> 00:00:29,507
Their big festival is every
October.
